# #Reclamation Project - Diamond City

department-DiamondCity = Diamond City
department-DiamondCity-description = Diamond City, the Great Green Jewel of the Commonwealth. A walled town built inside an old ballpark.

job-name-diamond-city-mayor = Diamond City Mayor
job-description-diamond-city-mayor = Lead Diamond City. Keep the people safe, the market open, and the walls standing.

job-name-diamond-city-security-chief = Diamond City Security Chief
job-description-diamond-city-security-chief = Run Diamond City Security. Organise the guards, answer to the Mayor, and keep the peace inside the walls.

job-name-diamond-city-security-sergeant = Diamond City Security Sergeant
job-description-diamond-city-security-sergeant = Lead a shift of Diamond City guards, train the recruits, and report to the Chief.

job-name-diamond-city-security-guard = Diamond City Security Guard
job-description-diamond-city-security-guard = Guard the gates and streets of Diamond City. Keep trouble out and keep the peace.

job-name-diamond-city-security-recruit = Diamond City Security Recruit
job-description-diamond-city-security-recruit = Join Diamond City Security. Learn the ropes, patrol with the guards, and follow your sergeant.

job-name-diamond-city-medic = Diamond City Medic
job-description-diamond-city-medic = Patch up the people of Diamond City and anyone who makes it to the gates.

job-name-diamond-city-shopkeeper = Diamond City Shopkeeper
job-description-diamond-city-shopkeeper = Run a shop in Diamond City's market. Buy, sell, and trade with the whole Commonwealth.

job-name-diamond-city-takahashi = Takahashi
job-description-diamond-city-takahashi = Diamond City's noodle-stand Protectron. Serve noodles to the people. You can only say "Nan-ni shimasho-ka?". Make Noodle Cups with your power (2 caps each) or cook them.

job-name-diamond-city-townsfolk = Diamond City Townsfolk
job-description-diamond-city-townsfolk = Live in Diamond City. Work, trade, gossip, and make a life inside the walls.

job-supervisors-diamond-city-people = the people of Diamond City
job-supervisors-diamond-city-mayor = the Mayor of Diamond City
job-supervisors-diamond-city-security-chief = the Diamond City Security Chief
job-supervisors-diamond-city-security-sergeants = your Diamond City Security sergeants

